      "sha256": "68c5aa4978ff2d5d0ee665386245618065673180d2406f83fb3ccc0ec1d2af8f",
      "kind": "figure",
      "alt": "Figure 1: Asynchronous interactions between developers and helpers can occur in three stages: making a request (S1), writing a response (S2), and integrating the response (S3). In Codeon, developers use an IDE plug-in to make requests (S1) and integrate responses (S3), and helpers use a web-based IDE to view content and generate responses (S2)."
    },
    {
