      "kind": "figure",
      "alt": "Figure 2: Codeon interface where the requests and responses are on the right panel(2). Developer’s code(1) and helper’s code(3) are side by side for better comparison. Other responses includes explanation(4), annotation(5), and comments(6)"
    },
